=\"markdown\" data-code=\"---&#10;description: Git 提交信息规范&#10;alwaysApply: false&#10;globs: []&#10;---&#10;&#10;- 提交信息使用 Conventional Commits 格式&#10;- 类型: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test, chore&#10;- 格式: &lt;type&gt;(&lt;scope&gt;): &lt;description&gt;&#10;- description 使用英文，首字母小写，不加句号&#10;- 单次提交只做一件事\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Git 提交信息规范</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alwaysApply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">globs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 提交信息使用 Conventional Commits 格式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 类型: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test, chore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 格式: &#x3C;type>(&#x3C;scope>): &#x3C;description></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\